{{Economy of Balisca}}

The '''Auster Corporation''' is an [[Balisca|Baliscan]] [[W:aerospace manufacturer|aerospace]], [[W:military|defense, arms]], [[W:Information security|security]], and [[W:technology|advanced technologies]] company with [[Mutual Arms and Technology Agreement|international interests]]. It is headquartered in [[Uxiu]], [[Bayara]]. Auster employs approximately 80,000 employees worldwide, including about 30,000 engineers and scientists as of January 2022.

